<main id="main" tabindex="-1"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="index.php">Raw materials</a> / Edit material</div><div class="page-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">UC-M03 / EMPLOYEE DEMONSTRATION</span><h1>Edit raw material</h1><p>Update material details, or record a stock change with its reason.</p></div></div><div id="page-error" class="notice error" role="alert" hidden></div><div class="form-layout" id="editor-layout"><div class="stack"><form id="material-form" class="panel" data-mode="edit" novalidate><div id="form-errors" class="notice error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><fieldset><legend>Material information</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field full"><label for="name">Material name <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="name" name="name" required maxlength="80" aria-describedby="name-error"><span class="field-error" id="name-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="description">Description <span class="required">(optional)</span></label><input id="description" name="description" maxlength="255" aria-describedby="description-error"><span class="field-error" id="description-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="unit">Unit of measure <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="unit" name="unit" required aria-describedby="unit-help unit-error"><option value="">Select a unit</option><option value="sq m">sq m (square meters)</option><option value="m">m (meters)</option><option value="kg">kg (kilograms)</option><option value="L">L (liters)</option><option value="each">each (individual pieces)</option></select><small id="unit-help">Quantities, costs, and reorder levels all use this unit.</small><span class="field-error" id="unit-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="unitCost">Unit cost in USD <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="unitCost" name="unitCost" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="unitCost-help unitCost-error"><small id="unitCost-help">Cost per one unit. Internal information.</small><span class="field-error" id="unitCost-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><fieldset><legend>Reorder and status</legend><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="reorderLevel">Reorder level <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="reorderLevel" name="reorderLevel" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="reorderLevel-help reorderLevel-error"><small id="reorderLevel-help">A low-stock indicator appears at or below this amount.</small><span class="field-error" id="reorderLevel-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="status">Material status <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="status" name="status" required aria-describedby="status-error"><option>Active</option><option>Inactive</option></select><span class="field-error" id="status-error"></span></div></div></fieldset><div class="form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Save details</button><a class="btn" id="cancel-form" href="index.php">Cancel</a><small>Temporary demo changes only</small></div></form><form id="adjust-form" class="panel" novalidate aria-labelledby="adjust-title"><h2 id="adjust-title" class="section-title">Record a stock adjustment</h2><p class="muted">Quantity on hand is never typed over. Each change is logged with a reason and the employee who made it.</p><div id="adjust-errors" class="notice error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label for="type">Reason for change <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="type" name="type" required aria-describedby="type-error"><option value="">Select a reason</option><option value="delivery">Delivery received (+)</option><option value="production">Used in production (−)</option><option value="correction-add">Count correction (+)</option><option value="correction-subtract">Count correction (−)</option></select><span class="field-error" id="type-error"></span></div><div class="field"><label for="amount">Amount <span class="required">(required)</span></label><input id="amount" name="amount" type="number" min="0.01" step="0.01" required aria-describedby="amount-help amount-error"><small id="amount-help">Enter a positive amount; the reason sets the direction.</small><span class="field-error" id="amount-error"></span></div><div class="field full"><label for="adjEmployee">Recorded by <span class="required">(required)</span></label><select id="adjEmployee" name="adjEmployee" required aria-describedby="adjEmployee-error"><option value="">Select an employee</option><option value="E01">E01 · Alex Morgan</option><option value="E02">E02 · Sam Rivera</option></select><span class="field-error" id="adjEmployee-error"></span></div></div><p id="adjust-preview" class="preview" role="status"></p><div class="form-footer"><button class="primary" type="submit">Record adjustment</button><small>Stock cannot go below zero</small></div></form></div><aside class="panel aside"><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT STOCK</span><h2 id="current-stock">—</h2><ul><li>Deliveries add stock and update the most recent purchase date.</li><li>Production use and corrections that subtract cannot take stock below zero.</li><li>The material ID cannot be changed. The unit locks once the material has stock, history, or product links.</li><li>Unit cost changes apply to future purchases; past adjustments keep their history.</li></ul><p class="notice">This prototype updates sample data in this tab. It does not write to a database.</p></aside></div></main>
